# Don Hidalgo, the estanciero: about 65 (age 0.8), heavier, with white
# hair (hair.mhmat), grey eyebrows and a white moustache. The middle-aged
# skin: the old one reads too dark under the sun. A dark three-piece suit
# (an open, hip-length jacket with lapels and squared shoulders, a
# waistcoat with a gold watch chain and trousers tucked into brown boots)
# over a white shirt with a stiff high band collar with small wing tips
# and no tie, and a felt hat with the widest flat brim and a tall crown
# creased down the middle. The garments are cut from the body by the
# converter.
#
# Lines MakeHuman does not know (it warns and skips them) are read by
# tools/mh2gltf.py: piece (see ../README.md). Credits in ../CREDITS.md.
